# Kimss Java SDK — AI assistants

Follow [AI_INTEGRATION.md](AI_INTEGRATION.md) for every integration.

1. Never use `KimssClient` for chat/completions.
2. Always use the official OpenAI Java (OkHttp) client with `baseUrl("https://api.kimss.ai/v1")`.
3. Always inject `X-Kimss-Agent-Id` and `X-Kimss-Agent-Name` as default headers.
4. Vault Anthropic/Azure in Kimss; do not invent Anthropic inbound routes on api.kimss.ai.
5. Hermis / interceptors: forward Agent-Id headers; never strip them.
6. Kill switch: `agent_disabled`. Keys: `kimss_...`. Never “zero-trust”.

Onboarding: [docs/KIMSS_ONBOARDING.md](docs/KIMSS_ONBOARDING.md).
